   - AREA-BASED SYMMETRY SCORE: Compute symmetry adjusted for area impact, e.g., SCATTER_RATIO / PR.AXIS_RECTANGULARITY.

These transformations and interactions enhance feature variety and emphasize subtle patterns in vehicle shapes, improving downstream classification accuracy.

