- RECTANGULARITY_RATIO: Ratio of PR.AXIS_RECTANGULARITY to MAX.LENGTH_RECTANGULARITY to emphasize variations in rectangularity patterns. (numerical), range = [0.1176470588235294, 0.1666666666666666], Q1 = 0.1310344827586207, Median = 0.1381578947368421, Q3 = 0.1463414634146341, Mean = 0.1389, Std = 0.0100
- PR.AXIS_ASPECT_RATIO: (minor axis)/(major axis) (numerical), range = [47, 133], Q1 = 57.0, Median = 62.0, Q3 = 66.0, Mean = 62.0138, Std = 7.9486
- PR.AXIS_RECTANGULARITY: area/(pr.axis length*pr.axis width) (numerical), range = [17, 29], Q1 = 19.0, Median = 20.0, Q3 = 23.0, Mean = 20.6193, Std = 2.5836
- MAX.LENGTH_ASPECT_RATIO: (length perp. max length)/(max length) (numerical), range = [3, 52], Q1 = 7.0, Median = 8.0, Q3 = 10.0, Mean = 8.6469, Std = 4.5056
- CIRCULARITY_RATIO: Ratio of CIRCULARITY to COMPACTNESS to highlight circularity relative to compactness. (numerical), range = [0.3571428571428571, 0.6082474226804123], Q1 = 0.4470588235294118, Median = 0.4842105263157895, Q3 = 0.5142857142857142, Mean = 0.4788, Std = 0.0477
- HOLLOWS_DIFF: Difference between HOLLOWS_RATIO and ELONGATEDNESS to capture hollow spaces relative to elongation. (numerical), range = [122, 175], Q1 = 147.0, Median = 157.0, Q3 = 165.0, Mean = 155.1203, Std = 11.5964
- GYRATION_ZSCORE: Z-score normalization of SCALED_RADIUS_OF_GYRATION to identify outliers in gyration patterns. (numerical), range = [-2.011727478979072, 2.847049141536251], Q1 = -0.8199520814941814, Median = 0.0051231936876658, Q3 = 0.7079650947684988, Mean = 0.0000, Std = 1.0000
- SHAPE_SYMMETRY_SCORE: Product of COMPACTNESS and SCATTER_RATIO to combine shape and symmetry in a single metric. (numerical), range = [9198, 29415], Q1 = 12668.5, Median = 14490.0, Q3 = 20168.0, Mean = 16140.0276, Std = 4474.0739
- AXIS_ASPECT_DIFF: Difference between PR.AXIS_ASPECT_RATIO and MAX.LENGTH_ASPECT_RATIO to assess relative axis ratios. (numerical), range = [39, 85], Q1 = 49.0, Median = 53.0, Q3 = 57.0, Mean = 53.3669, Std = 6.0413
- SIZE_ELONGATION_RATIO: Ratio of SCALED_RADIUS_OF_GYRATION to ELONGATEDNESS to assess how mass distribution relates to elongation. (numerical), range = [2.081967213114754, 10.153846153846152], Q1 = 3.30690737833595, Median = 4.043478260869565, Q3 = 6.030776515151516, Mean = 4.5822, Std = 1.7085
- RADIUS_RATIO: (max.rad-min.rad)/av.radius (numerical), range = [105, 322], Q1 = 143.0, Median = 168.0, Q3 = 197.0, Mean = 170.2919, Std = 33.1662
- KURTOSIS_ABOUT_MINOR_AXIS: (4th order moment about major axis)/sigma_min**4 (numerical), range = [0, 38], Q1 = 5.0, Median = 11.0, Q3 = 19.0, Mean = 12.5700, Std = 8.6111
- SKEWNESS_ABOUT_MAJOR_AXIS: (3rd order moment about major axis)/sigma_min**3 (numerical), range = [60, 119], Q1 = 67.0, Median = 71.0, Q3 = 75.0, Mean = 72.1164, Std = 7.0593
- SCALED_VARIANCE_ALONG_MINOR_AXIS: (2nd order moment about major axis)/area (numerical), range = [184, 1018], Q1 = 319.0, Median = 363.0, Q3 = 601.0, Mean = 442.5779, Std = 176.1384
- KURTOSIS_ABOUT_MAJOR_AXIS: (4th order moment about minor axis)/sigma_maj**4 (numerical), range = [176, 204], Q1 = 185.0, Median = 189.0, Q3 = 193.0, Mean = 189.1440, Std = 6.0685
- SCATTER_RATIO: (inertia about minor axis)/(inertia about major axis) (numerical), range = [112, 265], Q1 = 147.0, Median = 157.0, Q3 = 200.5, Mean = 169.3866, Std = 33.0825
- ASYMMETRY_SCORE_MINOR: Ratio of SKEWNESS_ABOUT_MINOR_AXIS to KURTOSIS_ABOUT_MINOR_AXIS to capture asymmetry along the minor axis. (numerical), range = [0.0, inf], Q1 = 0.2142857142857142, Median = 0.4761904761904761, Q3 = 1.0, Mean = inf, Std = nan
- ASYMMETRY_SCORE_MAJOR: Ratio of SKEWNESS_ABOUT_MAJOR_AXIS to KURTOSIS_ABOUT_MAJOR_AXIS to reflect asymmetry along the major axis. (numerical), range = [0.2955665024630542, 0.6574585635359116], Q1 = 0.3489583333333333, Median = 0.3782383419689119, Q3 = 0.4054054054054054, Mean = 0.3826, Std = 0.0479
- RECTANGULARITY_ELONGATION_PRODUCT: Product of RECTANGULARITY_RATIO and SIZE_ELONGATION_RATIO to assess how rectangular shapes connect to the elongation-distributed mass. (numerical), range = [0.2755494505494504, 1.682294037323622], Q1 = 0.4552715798381038, Median = 0.5344882390336934, Q3 = 0.8787411021756371, Mean = 0.6441, Std = 0.2718
- ASYMMETRY_BALANCE_DIFF: Difference between ASYMMETRY_SCORE_MAJOR and ASYMMETRY_SCORE_MINOR to measure symmetry balance between major and minor axes. (numerical), range = [-inf, 0.6378378378378379], Q1 = -0.6223404255319149, Median = -0.0869565217391304, Q3 = 0.1585998271391528, Mean = -inf, Std = nan
- GYRATION_SCATTER_PRODUCT: Product of GYRATION_ZSCORE and SCATTER_RATIO to capture the interplay between mass distribution standardization and inertia distribution. (numerical), range = [-284.528977655104, 714.609334525599], Q1 = -113.96336416821701, Median = 0.717247116273212, Q3 = 140.22795906383794, Mean = 26.3725, Std = 185.7062
- CIRCULARITY_HOLLOW_PRODUCT: Product of CIRCULARITY_RATIO and HOLLOWS_DIFF to reflect the interplay between circularity metrics and hollow area differences. (numerical), range = [47.364705882352936, 102.18556701030928], Q1 = 67.65484515484515, Median = 75.14606741573033, Q3 = 81.370653907496, Mean = 74.3248, Std = 9.6224
- SHAPE_SYMMETRY_ELONGATION: Product of SHAPE_SYMMETRY_SCORE and AXIS_ASPECT_DIFF to amplify combined symmetry patterns and aspect ratio variations. (numerical), range = [441504, 1781028], Q1 = 649065.0, Median = 803584.0, Q3 = 1062489.5, Mean = 861083.5700, Std = 252923.6604

