TION_SCATTER_PRODUCT and CIRCULARITY_HOLLOW_PRODUCT to capture mass distribution irregularities tied to circularity and hollows.\\n# Usefulness: Enhances understanding of the interplay between mass distribution anomalies and shape-related characteristics, crucial for outlier detection.\\ndf[\'GYRATION_SCATTER_COMPOSITE\'] = df[\'GYRATION_SCATTER_PRODUCT\'] * df[\'CIRCULARITY_HOLLOW_PRODUCT\']", "# SHAPE_VARIANCE_RATIO\\n# Ratio of SCATTER_RATIO to SCALED_VARIANCE_ALONG_MINOR_AXIS to investigate variability in shape distribution.\\n# Usefulness: Highlights inertia-based shape distribution differences tied to variance metrics, aiding classification tasks.\\ndf[\'SHAPE_VARIANCE_RATIO\'] = df[\'SCATTER_RATIO\'] / df[\'SCALED_VARIANCE_ALONG_MINOR_AXIS\']", "# COMBINED_SHAPE_FACTOR\\n# Product of RECTANGULARITY_RATIO, SHAPE_SYMMETRY_SCORE, and CIRCULARITY_RATIO to merge key shape properties.\\n# Usefulness: Creates a comprehensive feature combining geometry, symmetry, and circularity for robust shape classification.\\ndf[\'COMBINED_SHAPE_FACTOR\'] = df[\'RECTANGULARITY_RATIO\'] * df[\'SHAPE_SYMMETRY_SCORE\'] * df[\'CIRCULARITY_RATIO\']", "# GLOBAL_SHAPE_COMPLEXITY\\n# Cumulative product of SCATTER_RATIO, SHAPE_SYMMETRY_SCORE, and RECTANGULARITY_ELONGATION_PRODUCT for a holistic representation of shape complexity.\\n# Usefulness: Aggregates shape, symmetry, and rectangularity measures into one descriptor, enhancing differentiation of complex silhouette patterns.\\ndf[\'GLOBAL_SHAPE_COMPLEXITY\'] = df[\'SCATTER_RATIO\'] * df[\'SHAPE_SYMMETRY_SCORE\'] * df[\'RECTANGULARITY_ELONGATION_PRODUCT\']"]': 0.005917159763313529}]
