# NONLINEAR_ASPECT_COMPARISON
# Logarithmic difference between PR.AXIS_ASPECT_RATIO and MAX.LENGTH_ASPECT_RATIO to capture subtle aspect ratio variations.
# Usefulness: Captures nonlinear patterns in aspect ratio differences, emphasizing nuanced variations critical to classification tasks.
